{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold your lighter close, it's dark out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take the role of Seph, an artistically inclined child who embarks on a sprawling journey across their unusual world- all just to get food for their dog. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the topsy-turvy lands of this world as you make some new friends, meet peculiar citizens, fight off nightmarish creatures, and uncover dark and unsettling truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D RPG gameplay with minor platforming elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several distinct areas to explore with branching pathways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies to encounter, each presenting their own challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A progression system based around Seph's art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of peculiar characters scattered throughout the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 recruitable friends to travel and fight along side you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can pet the dog</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819680?t=1774212610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819680/51b69af43c49bea61b1fdd2634da098a72b2247e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774212610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819680/8cf772ccfc71289adffaf72c74d6b69d17e8f0ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774212610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819680/8cf772ccfc71289adffaf72c74d6b69d17e8f0ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774212610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3841080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold your lighter close, it's dark out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take the role of Seph, an artistically inclined child who embarks on a sprawling journey across their unusual world- all just to get food for their dog. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the topsy-turvy lands of this world as you make some new friends, meet peculiar citizens, fight off nightmarish creatures, and uncover dark and unsettling truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D RPG gameplay with minor platforming elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several distinct areas to explore with branching pathways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies to encounter, each presenting their own challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A progression system based around Seph's art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of peculiar characters scattered throughout the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 recruitable friends to travel and fight along side you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can pet the dog</p></li></ul>","developers":["Tristan O."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819680/da303f4c2757008957046d7476e8db53baf17d85/header.jpg?t=1774212610","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Little One","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong>